{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n タイトルを\n \n 初代ぶりっ子女王柿崎芽実\n \n スノープリンセス柿崎芽実\n \n 最強ベビーフェイス柿崎芽実\n \n どれにしようか散々迷った結果\n \n 『井口目線#~』\n にすることにしました\n \n 眞緒撮だと\n 真似すぎるなあ〜と\n 思ったので\n \n ちょっと\n アレンジしました（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRJT8Y7A0JPBPC2H7FZFX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 待機中のめみちゃん\n \n よくメイクをしてもらう\n メイクさんが\n 同じなことが多いので\n \n 眞緒撮は\n めみちゃん登場率\n 高くなる気がします\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRKQQSFFKGTYDDCBB332A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRMPP01FGA2R6RQHK6XCM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRNNJ8R20PA44924CPNEX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRPKQ92RXSQPTQNY154KD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRQK8BJ2DQH6313QKP2NG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ちょっと呆れつつも\n ちゃんと相手をしてくれるめみちゃん\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRRPM53NV4FYY979A2Z39","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRSP6TPD88381D2BPJJQ7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHFRTMKJXAHKA95FP2DAPQF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 赤ちゃんみたいな顔をしながら\n 魔性の女なような表情を\n よくするような気がします📸\n \n クスッと笑う微笑身の中に\n 色気が潜んでいる👶\n \n \n では次回もお楽しみに〜"}],"source":"archive"}